#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-server-releases.md:14
msgid ""
"Mattermost releases a new server version on the 16th of each month in "
"[binary form](https://docs.mattermost.com/administration-guide/upgrade"
"/upgrading-mattermost-server.html)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/mattermost-server-releases.md:15
msgid ""
"See the [v11 changelog](https://docs.mattermost.com/product-"
"overview/mattermost-v11-changelog.html) for details on what's coming and "
"changing in the next major release."
msgstr ""

